<title>USA: Sierra Health says Nevada okays merger.</title>
<headline>Sierra Health says Nevada okays merger.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sierra Health Services Inc said Tuesday its acquisition of Prime Holdings Inc had been approved by the Nevada Division of Insurance.</p>
<p>&quot;The insurance commissioner's approval enables us to complete this acquisition by year-end,&quot; Anthony Marlon, Sierra chief executive officer, said in a statement.</p>
</text>
